WEBVTT

00:08:59.317 --> 00:09:01.377
that helped drive
the price down 80 percent.

00:09:01.377 --> 00:09:04.100
We should be doing that
with 10 technologies, or a dozen,

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.603
around the world.

00:09:05.603 --> 00:09:07.963
We need policy as the magic sauce

00:09:07.963 --> 00:09:11.687
to go through those four sectors
in the biggest countries,

00:09:11.687 --> 00:09:12.817
in all countries.

00:09:12.817 --> 00:09:15.197
And one of the things that animates me

00:09:15.197 --> 00:09:18.913
is that this requires people
who are concerned about climate change,

00:09:18.913 --> 00:09:20.153
which should be everybody,

00:09:20.153 --> 00:09:24.227
those folks have to apply their energies
on the policies that matter

00:09:24.227 --> 00:09:26.313
with the decision-makers who matter.

00:09:26.313 --> 00:09:28.400
If you don't know
who the decision-maker is

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.850
to decarbonize the grid,

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:32.573
or to produce electric vehicles
in the policy world,